+/// (`link_dedup.rs`), so the summarized body under that name -- `current` is keyed exactly as
+/// the program is -- is the code the call runs. No body there (no item, a stub, an item the lane
+/// did not build such as the synthesized allocator shims, or one not summarized yet) is the
+/// fail-closed [`OpaqueCause::Foreign`].
+fn foreign_definition(
